ow doctrine: strike at Orchid camp with cavalry. The other enemy movements are old, so I'll focus on the immediate threat/opportunity."},{"seq":405,"t":2700,"type":"courier","id":"c162","house":"rhino","letter":"L196","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1","s-west","orchid-camp"],"depart":2700,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT ORCHID CAMP.","cipher":null},{"seq":406,"t":2700,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1684,"retries":0},{"seq":407,"t":2700,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"The Tiger presence at S-East is concerning. My doctrine mandates holding the East Ford with Ele/Inf and Archers on N-Bank. I must reinforce F3 and secure N-Bank East. I will re-send orders twice to ensure they are received."},{"seq":408,"t":2700,"type":"courier","id":"c163","house":"kite","letter":"L197","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":3000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":409,"t":2700,"type":"courier","id":"c164","house":"kite","letter":"L198","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":3000,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"AKWINJ, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG NTRS."},{"seq":410,"t":2700,"type":"courier","id":"c165","house":"kite","letter":"L199","kind":"order","to":"kite-ele-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":3000,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":"NHNMDTJSR, ITQLD SK NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":411,"t":2700,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1653,"retries":0},{"seq":412,"t":2700,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"My doctrine suggests peace first. Rhino has a truce, but I should try to initiate contact. I will use cipher for secrecy. I need to secure the middle ford (F2) while others fight. I'll move my infantry to secure F1/F2 area."},{"seq":413,"t":2700,"type":"courier","id":"c166","house":"orchid","letter":"L200","kind":"order","to":"orchi